# CC-Cowork GitHub Sync — whitelist ONLY knowledge/cc-*.md
# Uses **/* to match all files at any depth, then carves exceptions

# Ignore all files at any depth
**/*

# Allow .gitignore itself
!.gitignore

# Allow directory traversal (without this git cannot descend)
!**/

# Allow ONLY cc-*.md inside any knowledge/ directory
!**/knowledge/cc-*.md
